WEBVTT

00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:05.889
Student allocations

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:11.332
Open Hostel and Allocations. The students who hold a bed are listed.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:21.733
Press Allocate Student. Choose the student, the hostel and a room that has a free bed.

00:00:31.549 --> 00:00:36.183
Press Allocate. The student appears in the list with the room.

00:00:38.886 --> 00:00:43.000
To free a bed, press Vacate on the student and confirm.

00:00:47.229 --> 00:00:52.323
Choose Vacated in the status filter to see students who left, with the date.

00:00:55.850 --> 00:01:00.514
Allocations up to date
